The Archer A7 is very similar to the [[toh:tp-link:archer_c7|Archer C7]], but it has its own set of firmware. One difference is that the A7's switch shows only eth0, but the C7's switch shows eth0 and eth1.
It has five 1 GBit/s Ethernet ports and has 2.4GHz and 5GHz Wifi integrated

The Archer A7 v5 uses the [[docs:techref:targets:ath79|ath79 target]] since the 19.07 firmware. This replaced the previous ar71xx target.
Links to the current OpenWrt firmware can be found on the [[:toh:hwdata:tp-link:tp-link_archer_a7_v5|Techdata page]] 

